      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The camera will essentially take over your viewpoint as long as you do *not* have a render texture assigned. This means that if you put it above and behind you, you will have a perfectly working third person view. It works very well in desktop but can get a little weird if a VR user uses the avatar.\n\nYou can also put the viewpoint very far behind your head, but this causes other issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
